he world competing in the U-17 World Cup gather to start things off with the Pre-World Cup exhibition matches.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9271457/screencap/62e4bcf21a88d.jpg"},{"title":"A Moment Ahead in the Future","synopsis":"With one win each, Japan and Germany continue to face off in the third match of the Pre-World Cup exhibition.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9271458/screencap/62e4bcdfd382d.jpg"},{"title":"Prince vs Prince","synopsis":"A mysterious man riding a horse suddenly challenges Ryoma to a tennis match on horseback!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9282319/screencap/62e4bccd81d45.jpg"},{"title":"Upset","synopsis":"The World Cup Group League commences and Japan battles it out with Greece and Australia."},{"title":"Absolute Away Game","synopsis":"Team Japan’s #2 doubles players, Yukimura and Sanada, face a daunting match as the crowd is overwhelmingly filled with supporters for Australia, the home team."},{"title":"Chess King","synopsis":"Japan continues their match against Australia with #1 doubles. Atobe and Fuji take on a super offensive doubles pair with big serves.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9325326/screencap/631ebfedca421.jpg"},{"title":"One`s Resolve... One`s Conditions","synopsis":"Having lost both doubles matches against Switzerland, Japan begins its decisive #3 singles between Akutsu and Switzerland’s Amadeus.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9325327/screencap/631ebffdacb10.jpg"},{"title":"Feelings for My Friends","synopsis":"Ryoma needs to decide if Team USA is where he truly belongs. Meanwhile, the teams gear up for the Finals Tournament that starts in two days.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9325328/screencap/631ec00a667d3.jpg"},{"title":"Beyond the Bible","synopsis":"The U-17 World Cup semi-final matches continue with France versus Japan. Can Kimijima and Shiraishi beat the aesthetically-inclined Tristan and Timothée of France in both tennis and charm?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9346532/screencap/631ec0b2b5415.jpg"},{"title":"The Worst Doubles Pair","synopsis":"Team Japan’s Yanagi and Mori are partners for #1 doubles against France, but they obviously don’t get along at all. Can they smooth things out between them before it’s too late?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9346534/screencap/631ec10b1c166.jpg"},{"title":"Prince of Ace","synopsis":"It’s finally time for Ryoma to settle things with Chardard in #3 singles against France.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9357240/screencap/6330567251529.jpg"},{"title":"Samurai vs Knight","synopsis":"Ryoma’s match with Chardard continues in #3 singles of Japan versus France. Whichever team is victorious will advance to play Germany.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/9357241/screencap/633056c02c064.jpg"}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
